<title>GERMANY: German share market closed for Christmas holiday.</title>
<headline>German share market closed for Christmas holiday.</headline>
<text>
<p>German share market closed Tuesday for Christmas holiday. Market reopens on Friday. The DAX index closed floor trade down 8.88 points at 2,845.57 on Monday. The IBIS DAX index closed electronic trade up 8.55 points at 2,844.09 on Monday.</p>
